# Local config
.mcp.json
.env.local
instructions.md
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Credentials and session data.
# The first three are artifacts of mechanisms this server no longer has —
# `.credentials.enc`/`.salt` came from `login.py --setup` + EXCHANGE_MASTER_PASSWORD,
# `session-cookies.txt` from the pre-browser requests transport (both removed, see
# PROJECT_STATUS.md §"Update 2026-09-10"). Nothing writes them anymore, but the rules
# stay: an old checkout still has those files on disk, and this repository is public,
# so dropping the rule is how an encrypted credential blob gets committed. Do not
# "clean up" these three lines — delete the files instead.
.credentials.enc
.salt
session-cookies.txt
.browser-profile*/
.mcpregistry_*

# Capability-discovery captures (real mailbox metadata: endpoints, field names,
# UI labels from a live session — see exchange_mcp/discovery_session.py)
.discovery-sessions/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.playwright-mcp/

# Smoke test suite runtime state (server pid/log, result log)
tests/smoke/.state/
